WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,360 --> 00:00:02,260
Mr. Zhang

2
00:00:02,320 --> 00:00:03,920
Officer Zhi'an took Assistant Chen away

3
00:00:04,240 --> 00:00:05,520
HR came and told me

4
00:00:05,920 --> 00:00:07,080
Don't know what happened

5
00:00:07,080 --> 00:00:08,480
Will it have any impact on the company?

6
00:00:09,040 --> 00:00:10,000
When did it happen?

7
00:00:10,320 --> 00:00:11,600
about two hours ago

8
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:12,720
You just joined the club not long ago

9
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:14,360
I asked the security guard to stay on this floor.

10
00:00:15,440 --> 00:00:17,840
Jiang Wenlong took action so quickly

11
00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:20,040
Then why are you saying it now?

12
00:00:20,440 --> 00:00:22,320
This meeting is very important. I want to wait until you finish it.

13
00:00:22,320 --> 00:00:24,800
Is there any meeting that is more important than people? Check it out immediately.

14
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:32,880
Who took him to where?

15
00:00:33,160 --> 00:00:35,320
Weren't you taken away? Aren't you back?

16
00:00:36,010 --> 00:00:40,490
Did they touch you? I'm fine. How did you get back?

17
00:00:40,690 --> 00:00:43,850
How could they let someone go and just come back like this?

18
00:00:44,050 --> 00:00:45,290
It was just a misunderstanding

19
00:00:45,410 --> 00:00:46,810
So after explaining it, let me come back.

20
00:00:47,780 --> 00:00:51,850
When I ask you, please be serious and tell the truth. I don't believe Jiang Wenge.

21
00:00:51,850 --> 00:00:54,750
He would let you go so easily and ask him for help

22
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:57,430
Things are easy to solve, you can do it yourself

23
00:00:57,710 --> 00:00:58,630
Or handle it yourself

24
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:00,630
Why do they talk to you for no reason?

25
00:01:01,110 --> 00:01:02,350
Do you think I am a three-year-old?

26
00:01:02,950 --> 00:01:04,630
What happened to Chen Yundong?

27
00:01:05,030 --> 00:01:12,470
You have to tell me the matter before I can help you. Thank you, it's been solved. You have to work first.

28
00:01:19,360 --> 00:01:20,880
It's like I'm begging you to help me
